* Overload thermal-simulation protection unit
* Rungs: 0.5 A per light-overload pulse, 1.0 A per heavy-overload pulse.
* Level 1 (2.0 A): relay 1 closes -> overheat lamp.
* Level 2 (2.5 A): relay 2 closes -> alarm.
* Saturates at 2.5 A; RESET clears everything.
*
* Stimulus below is a demo: IH once at 1 ms, IL at 21/46/71/96 ms,
* RESET at 110 ms. Replace the three PULSE sources with buttons in the lab.
VDD vdd 0 DC 5
VIH ih 0 PULSE(0 5 1m 10u 10u 2m 1000m)
VIL il 0 PULSE(0 5 21m 10u 10u 2m 25m)
VRST rst 0 PULSE(5 0 110m 10u 10u 1000m 2000m)
* accumulator (one unit = 0.5 A) and the next-state mux
AU1 clk rst vdd vdd 0 n0 n1 n2m 0 q0 q1 q2 q3 rco 0 vdd 74LS161
AU2 0 ih n0a n0b n1a n1b n2 n2 0 0 n0 n1 n2m nu4 0 vdd 74LS157
* thresholds: u >= 4 (2.0 A) and u >= 5 (2.5 A)
AU3 q0 0 q1 0 q2 vdd 0 0 0 0 vdd g1a g1b g1c 0 vdd 74LS85
AU4 q0 vdd q1 0 q2 vdd 0 0 0 0 vdd g2a g2b g2c 0 vdd 74LS85
* saturating next-state logic: n = min(u+1, 5) / min(u+2, 5)
AU5 q0 nq0 0 vdd 74LS04
AU6 q2 nq2 0 vdd 74LS04
AU7 q1 nq1 0 vdd 74LS04
AU8 z n1b 0 vdd 74LS04
AU9 g1b ge1 0 vdd 74LS04
AU10 g2b ge2 0 vdd 74LS04
AU11 il nIL 0 vdd 74LS04
AU12 ih nIH 0 vdd 74LS04
AU13 nIL nIH clk 0 vdd 74LS00
AU14 q1 q0 t0 0 vdd 74LS00
AU15 q1 t0 t1 0 vdd 74LS00
AU16 q0 t0 t2 0 vdd 74LS00
AU17 t1 t2 xor 0 vdd 74LS00
AU18 nq2 xor ux 0 vdd 74LS00
AU19 ux ux n1a 0 vdd 74LS00
AU20 nq2 nq0 X 0 vdd 74LS00
AU21 q2 nq1 Y 0 vdd 74LS00
AU22 X Y n0a 0 vdd 74LS00
AU23 nq2 nq1 z 0 vdd 74LS00
AU24 nq2 t0 n2 0 vdd 74LS00
* integer digit = u/2 : D=0 C=0 B=q2 A=q1
AU25 vdd vdd 0 0 q2 q1 vdd oa1 ob1 oc1 od1 oe1 of1 og1 0 vdd 74LS48
AU26 oa1 na1 0 vdd 74LS04
AU27 ob1 nb1 0 vdd 74LS04
AU28 oc1 nc1 0 vdd 74LS04
AU29 od1 nd1 0 vdd 74LS04
AU30 oe1 ne1 0 vdd 74LS04
AU31 of1 nf1 0 vdd 74LS04
AU32 og1 ng1 0 vdd 74LS04
R1A na1 sa1 220
R1B nb1 sb1 220
R1C nc1 sc1 220
R1D nd1 sd1 220
R1E ne1 se1 220
R1F nf1 sf1 220
R1G ng1 sg1 220
RDP1 rdp1 0 220
AD1 sa1 sb1 sc1 sd1 se1 sf1 sg1 rdp1 vdd SEG
* fraction digit = 0 or 5 : D=0 C=q0 B=0 A=q0
AU33 vdd vdd 0 q0 0 q0 vdd oa2 ob2 oc2 od2 oe2 of2 og2 0 vdd 74LS48
AU34 oa2 na2 0 vdd 74LS04
AU35 ob2 nb2 0 vdd 74LS04
AU36 oc2 nc2 0 vdd 74LS04
AU37 od2 nd2 0 vdd 74LS04
AU38 oe2 ne2 0 vdd 74LS04
AU39 of2 nf2 0 vdd 74LS04
AU40 og2 ng2 0 vdd 74LS04
R2A na2 sa2 220
R2B nb2 sb2 220
R2C nc2 sc2 220
R2D nd2 sd2 220
R2E ne2 se2 220
R2F nf2 sf2 220
R2G ng2 sg2 220
AD2 sa2 sb2 sc2 sd2 se2 sf2 sg2 vdd vdd SEG
* relay 1 (overheat) and relay 2 (alarm) drivers
RB1 ge1 b1 4.7k
RB2 ge2 b2 4.7k
Q1 coil1 b1 0 Q2N2222
Q2 coil2 b2 0 Q2N2222
XRK1 vdd coil1 vdd k1_out @RELAY RCOIL=400 VON=3 VOFF=1
XRK2 vdd coil2 vdd k2_out @RELAY RCOIL=400 VON=3 VOFF=1
R1L k1_out l1a 330
D1L l1a 0 DLED
R2Z k2_out z2a 330
D2Z z2a 0 DLED
RNU4 nu4 0 10k
RGN1 ge1 0 10k
RGN2 ge2 0 10k
.model Q2N2222 NPN(IS=2.05e-13 BF=296 NF=1.1 VAF=10 IKF=0.077 ISE=1.45e-13 RB=4 RC=0.43 RE=0.086 CJE=1.1e-11 CJC=3.2e-11 TF=3e-10 TR=3.8e-7)
.model DLED D(IS=1e-19 N=1.8 RS=10 CJO=2e-12)
.end
